    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW21Gcxh7tJSwgq63Z29C3xeT)_\n\n**Before:** `* Open pull requests` in `CHANGELOG.org` listed about 50 PRs, nearly all already merged, with #166 and #79 twice, and 13 merged PRs had no line at all.\n\n**After:** I checked each PR's live state on GitHub. Only the PRs that are still open stay in that section: #125 and #171. The merged ones moved into their feature sets (I read \"relevant notes\" as the feature-set sections), in dependency order, with each set's date range widened:\n- Posframe (renamed from Mini-frame): #128, #134, #136, #137, #138, #140, #142, #144, #145, #146, #152, #154, #156, #157, #161, #163, #174\n- Note tags: #143, #158, #167, #176\n- Query tables: #164, #165, #168, #169, #172\n- Relationship annotator and graphs: #173 (after #58)\n- Dashboard: #133, #139\n- Font management: #147, #148\n- Mode line: #149; BibTeX: #162; Startup: #87, #93, #132, #141, #160; Module docs: #79, #81, #83, #84, #126, #129, #153\n- New sets: Quick capture (#131, #159), Links in notes (#150, #155, #166), Shell and terminal setup (#95, #96), Small commands and media (#127, #135)\n\nDuplicates removed: #166 (kept the line with the confirmed cause) and #79 (kept the fuller one). Older `text. ([[link]], Claude)` lines now use the standard `link (Claude) emoji text` form. No category headings were added.\n\n**Not in the list:** #175 is open, but its own branch carries its CHANGELOG entry, so adding it here would duplicate it on merge. #151 and #170 were closed without merging and appear nowhere.\n\n**Not checked:** #135 and #153 have no description, so their lines come from the file list.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9xMrZaYGjBrafs73L\n",
